  sig=func (m *Manager) nativeShadows(bound *boundTool) bool
  doc=nativeShadows keeps legacy local MCP bindings callable for journal replay\nwhile removing them from the model-facing inventory whenever the in-process\nnative runtime is active. One operation must have one canonical schema.
