  sig=func writeSkillSchema() llm.Tool
  doc=writeSkillSchema advertises the P2-2 skill-writing tool. The agent authors a\nstructured PatternSpec after a proven task; this tool validates it and\npersists it as a Neocortex Pattern (the synthesis loop). The spec mirrors\nPatternSpec exactly (name, trigger, preconditions, steps, gotchas,\nsuccess_criteria).
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/tools/tools.go

